------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Fix: Issue preventing BaNaNaS upload due to a lack of any checksum changes


1.0.2 (2021-10-16)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Update: Lots of translations
-Fix: Install location of 'make install'


1.0.1 (2021-03-23)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Fix: Old and modern bus sounds were swapped


1.0.0 (2021-03-12)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Change: Many sounds were replaced and reworked
-Change: License: CC BY-SA 3.0, GPLv2+, CDDL 1.1 (was: CC Sampling Plus)
-Change: Build system updated to support Git


0.2.3 (2010-03-31)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Fix: Do not rebuild the md5sums file which one wants to check against


0.2.2 (2010-03-24)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Add: Translations of the description of this set to about 30 languages
-Change: Improvements to the build system


0.2.1 (2009-12-23)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Change: Improve sample for the level crossing
-Change: Improvements to the build system


0.2.0 (2009-12-09)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Add: Missing toyland samples, resulting in 73 completed sounds


0.1.0 (2009-11-14)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Add: several sounds, resulting in 59 completed sounds


0.1.0-alpha2 (2009-08-14)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Add: several sounds, resulting in 50 completed sounds


0.1.0-alpha1 (2009-08-11)
